 "notes": "82 provinces + Metro Manila (ISO region PH-00 NCR, which has no provinces and is written as \"Metro Manila\"). PH-MAG Maguindanao was split (2022; ISO 2023-11-23) into PH-MGN Maguindanao del Norte and PH-MGS Maguindanao del Sur. The old code is aliased to PH-MGS (seat of the old province, Buluan, is in Maguindanao del Sur); saved values in the north will map wrongly and need re-selection."
